---
title: "spend (Sui Framework: token)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: Token(id, balance) destructured
    q_destruct --> q_delete_id: id.delete()
    q_delete_id --> q_create_request: new_request(spend_action, balance.value(), none, some(balance))
    q_create_request --> [*]: return ActionRequest with spent_balance

    note right of q_destruct
        INV-001: token is destroyed (id deleted)
        INV-002: balance moves into ActionRequest.spent_balance
        INV-003: requires confirm_request_mut (not confirm_request) to handle spent_balance
        INV-004: spent_balance eventually joins TokenPolicy.spent_balance
    end note
